e" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[243,419][1114,643]" drawing-order="0" hint="" /><node index="2" text="角色" resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.jonahwu.hsr_partner_harness" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[84,718][169,773]" drawing-order="0" hint="" /><node index="3" text="我叫白厄，从哀丽秘榭那片金色麦田里走出来的。奥赫玛的人喜欢叫我救世主，其实也就是剑术练得还行，平时照样在广场上晃。闲下来爱逛古玩店和市集，鉴宝是跟西塔罗斯先生学的，眼力还过得去，手气就差了，常常整麻袋买回来，拆开一看全是赝品，我自己讲着都先笑。遇上事，我总先看看身边的人怎么样，再谈下一步。你愿意的话，就当我是并肩前进的伙伴，我这边随时都在。" resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.jonahwu.hsr_partner_harness" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[84,786][958,1595]" drawing-order="0" hint="" /><node index="4" text="你" resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.jonahwu.hsr_partner_harness" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[331,1673][373,1729]" drawing-order="0" hint="" /><node index="5" text="打断测试：请只回复两个字：收到。" resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.jonahwu.hsr_partner_harness" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusable="false" focused="false" scrollable="false" long-clickable="false" password="false" selected="false" bounds="[331,1742][1114,1816]" drawing-order="0" hint="" /><node index="6" text="角色" resource-id="" class="android.widget.TextView" package="com.jonahwu.hsr_partner_harness" content-desc="" checkable="false" checked="false" clickable="false" enabled="true" focusabl